        <title>Animals</title>
        <p>Forty male C57BL/6 mice (aged 8-10 weeks) were housed under a 12h
        light/dark cycle. All procedures were approved by the Institutional
        Animal Care and Use Committee (IACUC). After testing, animals were
        euthanized.</p>
